  "notes": [
    "bed = Keep Workin' instrumental end to end; vocals follow Janice STFU's lyric structure (chorus repeats 32 bars apart)",
    "hooks land on the bed's full sections (25, 49, 92); chops fill the breakdowns (17-24, 65-80)",
    "title line a cappella in the bed's 3-bar break (89-91) right before the bar-92 drop",
    "keys: rap vocal (low tonality) over a low-confidence bed key; no pitch shift",
    "drop at bar 92: 8-bar build on bed, riser, impact, 1 beat(s) of silence",
    "drop at bar 81: 8-bar build on bed, riser, impact, 1 beat(s) of silence",
    "v4: vocal chain (rap on verses, hook on choruses), word-safe edges, vocal rider, master matched to the Keep Workin' original (Matchering), mono bass < 120 Hz, soft clip + true-peak limiter",
    "stem arrangement on bed: verses over drums + bass (melodic layer -60 dB), full beat under hooks, 1 drums-only bar before each hook, melodic layer pumps on the beat",
    "fills: crash 25, crash 49, crash 81, crash 92, swell into 25, swell into 49, swell into 92",
    "edit: mute at bar 47",
    "edit: tape_stop at bar 64.5",
    "DJ edges: 16-bar beat intro, 16-bar beat outro (looped from bar 5 of keep-workin)",
    "v6: punch + width contrast, vocal riser into 92, snare roll into 81, crashes + swells, beat-out under the title punchline, tape stop into the breakdown, light hook tuning, 16-bar DJ intro/outro",
    "bass follows the vocal's original chords under hook1, hook2, hook3, intro-verse (their sung notes sat a half-step off the beat's bassline)"
  ],
  "groove": {
    "pump_fx": {
      "db": 5.0,
      "release": 0.6
    }
  },
  "edits": [
